na":"Paddle Pulse aretoa","aria.canvas":"3Dko ikuspegia. Jokoa HTML interfazearen bidez ere eskuragarri dago.","hud.firstHint":"Arrastatu edo erabili. ← → Mugitzeko. Space - Zerbitzariak.","hud.go":"JOAN","common.guest":"Gonbidatua","reason.target-score-reached":"Helburua lortu da.","reason.time-limit-reached":"Epeak bete dira.","reason.match-conceded":"Partida onartuta.","reason.move-limit-exhausted":"Mugimenduaren muga agortu da.","constraint.move-limit":"Mugitu muga","constraint.speed-target":"Abiadura-helburua.","constraint.altered-layout":"Diseinu aldaketa","constraint.restricted-tools":"Erreminta mugatuak","palette.none":"Estandarra","palette.deuteranopia":"Deuteranopia","palette.protanopia":"Protanopia","palette.tritanopia":"Tritanopia","palette.high-contrast":"Kontraste handia","action.left":"Mugitu ezkerrera","action.right":"Mugitu eskuinera","action.serve":"Zerbitzatu","action.pause":"Etenaldia","action.undo":"Desegin","action.camera":"Kameraren ikuspegia","action.hint":"Aholkua","nat.report":"Arazo bat salatu.","nat.reportPlaceholder":"Zer gertatu da?","nat.reportSend":"Bidali txostena.","nat.reportSent":"Txostena bidali dute. — Eskerrik asko. Eskerrik asko.","nat.reportFailed":"Txostena ezin izan da bidali.","nat.options":"Aukerak...","nat.optionsNote":"Volumenak, grafikoak, hizkuntza, testuaren tamaina, mugimendu murriztua eta kontraste handikoa Aukeretan daude.","nat.cancel":"Utzi","nat.replayTutorials":"Erreproduzitu ikasgaiak","nat.tutorialsReset":"— ikastaroak berritzen dira.","nat.boardStarHermit":"StarHermit — lasterketa luzeena","nat.loading":"Kargatzen…","nat.boardUnavailable":"StarHermit taula ezin da irakurri.","nat.lobbyOffline":"— partekatutako pantailako 2P-a nonahi funtzionatzen du.","Force the corners, own the center.":"Inguratu txokoak, erdigunean egon.","Lesson 1 — Move":"1 — Mugitu","Slide your paddle left and right.":"Mugitu arrauna ezkerrera eta eskuinera.","Move your paddle toward the left wall. Drag, use ← →, or tap the left side.":"Mugitu arrauna ezkerreko paretera. Arrasta ezazu, erabili ← →, edo sakatu ezkerreko aldean.","Your paddle is the bright bar on your goal line.":"Zure arrauna zure helmuga lerroko barra distiratsua da.","Now move it toward the right wall.":"Orain mugitu eskuineko paretera.","The paddle follows your pointer or arrow keys.":"Paddle-ak zure seinalatzaile edo gezi teklei jarraitzen die.","Lesson 2 — Serve":"2 — Zerbitzatu","Put the ball in play.":"Sartu baloia jokoan.","The ball is yours. Press Space, tap the ball, or use the Serve button.":"Baloia zurea da. Sakatu Space, sakatu baloia, edo erabili zerbitzatu botoia.","Serving sends the ball toward the far goal line.":"Zerbitzuak baloia helmuga lerrora bidaltzen du.","Lesson 3 — Return":"3 — Itzulera","Meet the ball with your paddle.":"Baloiari aurre egin arraunarekin.","Return the ball once. Get your paddle under it before it crosses your line.":"Itzuli baloia behin. Jarri arrauna azpian, marra gurutzatu baino lehen.","Watch the trail — meet the ball, don’t chase it.":"Zaindu bidea. — Aurkitu baloia, ez jarraitu.","Lesson 4 — Angle":"4 ikasgaia — Angelu","Strike off-center to bend your return.":"Erdian kolpea egin, zure itzulera makurtzeko.","Hit the ball with the outer half of your paddle to send it wide.":"Jo baloia zure arraunaren kanpoko erdiaz zabaldu dezazun.","Edge hits bend the return; center hits go straight.":"Alde batetik jotzen du, buelta emanez, eta erdialdera zuzenean.","Lesson 5 — Score & Win":"5. ikasgaia — Lortu eta irabazi","Score through the far goal line to win.":"Goal-lerrotik sartu eta irabazi.","Score one point — send the ball past the far paddle, over the far line.":"— puntuazioa. Baloiari eraso.","Angled returns are harder to catch.":"Angularrak harrapatzea zailagoa da.","Finish it — win the match.":"Amaitu ezazu. — Partida irabazi.","First point wins this one.":"Lehen puntuak irabazten du.","First Contact":"Lehen kontaktua","Learn the arena. First to 3, slow ball.":"Ikasi zelaia. Lehenengo 3, pilota geldoa.","Ignition":"Pizketa","Return Form":"Itzulketa-orriak","Hold your ground and return cleanly.":"Eutsi zuen posizioari eta itzuli garbi.","Wide Guard":"Zaintza zabala.","A wider arena demands anticipation.":"Eremu zabalago batek aurreikuspenak eskatzen ditu.","Edge Work":"Mugako lana.","Use the paddle edge to bend returns.":"Erabili arraunaren ertza itzulerak makurtzeko.","Tempo":"Erritmoa","The ball gains pace with every hit.":"Baloiak erritmoa hartzen du kolpe bakoitzarekin.","Pressure Line":"Presio-lerroa","Opponent tracks faster. Stay calm.":"Aurkakoak azkarrago doaz. Lasaitu zaitez.","Ignition Trial":"Pizketa proba","Prove the basics under margin rules.":"Frogatu oinarrizko arauak.","Mastery: Ignition":"Maitasuna:","Mastery stage — win by 3 against Glide.":"Maisuaren fasea — Irabazi egin du. 3 Glide-ren aurka.","Angles":"Angeluak","Slice":"Zati bat.","Sharper returns, sharper angles.":"Itzulera zorrotzagoak, angelu zorrotzagoak.","Narrow Margin":"Marjina estua","A slimmer paddle, a slimmer path.":"Arraun finagoa, bide finagoa.","Long Court":"Gorte luzea.","A longer court rewards deep angles.":"Gorte luzeago batek zorte hobea ematen du angelu sakonekin.","Quickstep":"Quickstep","Faster exchanges. Read the rebound.":"Truke azkarragoak. Irakurri errebotaldia.","Corner Trap":"Izkinako tranpa.","Angles Gate":"Angels atea","Win with pace against Flow.":"Irabazi erritmoarekin Flow-ren aurka.","First Bumper":"Lehen babeslea.","A single deflector changes the map.":"Deflector bakar batek mapa aldatzen du.","Bumpers":"Talkak","Mastery: Angles":"Maitasuna: angeluak.","Mastery stage — angled returns, no cheap points.":"— maisu mailako itzulerak, ez puntu merkeak.","Twin Deflectors":"Bi deflectorrak","Two bumpers guard the middle.":"Bi babesle daude erdian.","Offset Lanes":"Ibilbideak desbideratu","Asymmetric deflectors. Re-read every rebound.":"Deflector asimetrikoak. Berriro irakurri.","Pinball":"Pinball jokoa","Four deflectors. Chaos is a pattern.":"Lau deflector. Kaosa patroi bat da.","Bumper Trial":"Aurreko proba.","Hold the line amid deflections.":"Eutsi lerroari desbideratzeen artean.","Crosswind":"Alde batetik.","A moving blocker sweeps mid-court.":"Blokeatzaile batek zelai erdian eraso du.","Double Sweep":"Bi aldiz aztertu.","Two blockers, alternating pressure.":"Bi blokeatzaile, presio aldakorra.","Crossfire":"Su gurutzatua","Crossfire Gate":"Su gurutzatuak.","Survive the sweep against Surge.":"Bizirik iraun Surgen aurkako erasoan.","Mastery: Crossfire":"Gaitasun bat:","Mastery stage — blockers and margin pressure.":"— blokeatzaileak eta presioa.","Overdrive":"Overdrive","The pace climbs. So do you.":"Azkarrago doa. Zuk ere bai.","Razor":"Bizarra moztekoa.","Slim paddle, full speed.":"Arraun arin bat, abiadura osoarekin.","Deep Court":"Gorte sakona.","The longest court at full pace.":"Puntu luzeena, abiadura osoz.","Reactor":"Erreaktorea","Deflectors at overdrive pace.":"Deflectoreak abiadura handikoak.","Blitz":"Blitz","Short target, sudden pressure.":"Helburu laburra, presio bat.","Ion Storm":"Ion Ekaitza.","Blockers sweep a fast court.":"Blokeatzaileek azkarrago egiten dute.","Overdrive Gate":"Atea gainditu.","Hold pace against Pulse.":"Pultsuaren aurka.","Mastery: Overdrive":"Gainditu ezazu.","Mastery stage — full speed, win by 3.":"— abiadura guztian, 3 puntu irabazi.","Zenith Approach":"Zenith Hurbilketa","The final chapter opens at pace.":"Azken kapitulua abiatzen ari da.","Mirror Maze":"Ispiluen labirintoa","Symmetric deflectors, asymmetric outcomes.":"Deflector simetrikoak, emaitza asimetrikoak.","Swept Court":"Auzitegian.","Everything moves. Including you.":"Dena mugitzen da. Zu barne.","Thin Ice":"Izotz mehea","Slim paddle against the best tracker.":"Paddle argala, bilatzaile onenaren aurka.","Mastery":"Maisutasuna","Full Court Press":"Auzitegiko prentsa.","A wide court, a fast ball, no excuses.":"Eremu zabala, pilota azkarra, aitzakiarik gabe.","Chaos Theory":"Kaosaren teoria","Every mechanic, one arena.":"Mekanikari bakoitza, areto bat.","The Long Rally":"Borroka Luzea","A marathon to seven against Zenith.":"Zenithen aurka maratoia zazpi.","Mastery: Zenith":"Maitasuna: Zenith","Final mastery — everything combined, win by 3.":"Azken maitasuna — dena konbinatuta, irabazi 3 puntu.","Economy of Motion":"Mugimenduaren ekonomia","Win 5–2 or better using at most 40 paddle commands. Every move counts.":"Irabazi 5–2 edo hobea gehienez 40 aginduz. Mugimendu bakoitzak balio du.","Overclocked":"Gaindituta dago.","The ball never drops below 22 units/s. Survive to 5.":"Pilotik ez da inoiz 22 unitate/s-tik behera jaisten. Bizirik iraun 5era.","Pinball Alley":"Pinball kalexka","Six deflectors own the court. First to 6 in the chaos.":"Sei deflector dauzkagu. Lehenengo 6 kaosean.","Toothpick":"Hortz-garbitzailea.","Restricted tools: your paddle is a sliver. Win anyway.":"Erreminta mugatuak: zure arrauna zati bat da. Dena dela, irabazi.","Sudden Death":"Bat-bateko heriotza","One point decides it. Full pace. No margin for error.":"Puntu batek erabakitzen du. Abiadura osoa. Ez dago akats-marjinarik.","The Gauntlet":"Gauntlet","Blockers, bumpers, a slim paddle, and a relentless opponent. Win by 3.":"Blokeatzaileak, paraxutistak, arraun fin bat eta aurkari nekaezina. Irabazi egin du. 3.","Calm":"Lasai","Steady":"Etengabe","Brisk":"Bizkorra.","Fierce":"Sutsu","Zenith":"Zenith","Standard":"Estandarra","Quickfire":"Tiro azkarra.","Deflector":"Desbideratzailea.","Sweep":"Arrastaka","Slimline":"Zintzilik.","Marathon":"Maratoia","First Light":"Lehen Argia","Win your first match.":"Irabazi zure lehen partida.","Angle Master":"Angelu nagusia.","Land 50 angled returns (outer-half paddle hits).":"Lurreratu 50 itzuli angeluan.","Five Alive":"Bost bizirik.","Win 5 matches in a row.":"Irabazi 5 borrokak jarraian.","Mastery Track":"Maisuaren ibilbidea.","Clear every Mastery stage in Journey.":"Garbitu Maisteritza maila guztiak Bidaian.","Centurion":"Zenturioia","Complete 100 matches, any mode.":"100 bat dator, edozein modutan.","Daily Devotee":"Eguneroko Devotazioa","Finish 7 daily challenges.":"Amaitu eguneroko 7 erronka.","Half the Horizon":"Horizonte erdia","Clear 20 Journey stages.":"Garbitu 20 Bidaiaren etapa.","Full Circuit":"Zirkuitu osoa.","Clear all 40 Journey stages.":"Garbitu bidaiaren 40 etapa guztiak.","Untouchable":"Ukiezinak.","Win a match without conceding a single point.":"Irabazi partida bat puntu bat ere galdu gabe.","Challenge Accepted":"Erronka onartu dute","Clear all six Challenges.":"Garbitu sei erronkak."}
